==================================================
DELIVERABLE
==================================================

Provide a complete installable WordPress theme.

The final theme should be installable through:

WordPress Admin
→ Appearance
→ Themes
→ Add New
→ Upload Theme

The theme should work immediately after activation.

Also provide:

1. Installation instructions
2. Required plugins, if any
3. Admin usage instructions
4. How to edit homepage content
5. How to add projects
6. How to add testimonials
7. How to edit contact information
8. How to edit social links
9. How to configure Google Analytics
10. How to configure SEO
11. Any remaining configuration required before production

IMPORTANT:

Do not use fake credentials, fake API keys, or fake Google Analytics IDs.

Do not claim the CMS is complete if important functionality is still hardcoded.

First analyze the existing project, then create the WordPress theme based on the existing design.